[0.310688,"o","\r\nmmended)\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;14m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;14mFull setup — configure every provider, tool & option yourself (bring your own \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;14mkeys)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\u001b[7A\u001b[39C\u001b[?25h\u001b[?25l\u001b[39D\u001b[38;5;10m>\u001b[39m How would you like to set up Hermes? \u001b[38;5;14mFull setup — configure every provider, to\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;14mol & option yourself (bring your own keys)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[?25h\u001b[6A\u001b[?25h\r\nModel & Provider\r\nChoose how to connect to your main chat model.\r\n   Guide: https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/integrations/providers\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;10m?\u001b[39m Select provider:  \r\n\u001b[38;5;14m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;14mNous Portal (Everything your agent needs, 300+ models with bundled tool use)\u001b[39m\r\n  Fireworks AI (OpenAI-compatible direct model API)\r\n  OpenRouter (Pay-per-use API aggregator)\r\n  Mixture of Agents (named presets; aggregator acts after reference models)\r\n  NovitaAI (Cloud: Model API, Agent Sandbox, GPU Cloud)\r\n  LM Studio (Local desktop app with built-in model server)\r\nv Anthropic (Claude models via API key or Claude Code)\r\n\u001b[38;5;14m[\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m↑↓ to move, enter to select, type to filter\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m]\u001b[39m\r\u001b[8A\u001b[19C\u001b[?25h"]
